verifier with the kernel's supported virtio-net queue-size contract\n- accept powers of two from 8 through 32768, including QEMU 10.0.13's 1024-entry queues\n- retain rejection of unsupported sizes and tolerate serial carriage returns\n\nReferences issue #4.\n\n## HDAE\n\nGate 19: `hdae/gates-todo/19-qemu-boot-queue-size-contract.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- exact regex probes: 256, 1024, and CR-terminated 1024 accepted; 0, 7, 255, 1000, and 65536 rejected\n- `make check`\n- `make test` on QEMU 10.1.2 under TCG: `GINUX_KERNEL_OK`; `Boot test passed.`\n\nThe issue contributor separately reproduced the original failure and validated the kernel-side PR #10 on QEMU 10.0.13.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:06:22Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-01T23:25:07Z", "closed_at": "2026-11-01T23:24:48Z", "merged_at": "2026-11-01T23:24:48Z", "merge_commit_sha": "e0af862712380e812322faa39397c0b75b72e3bb", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "gmkurtzer:hdae/issue-4-boot-queue-size", "ref": "hdae/issue-4-boot-queue-size", "repo": {"id": 1413787216, "node_id": "R_kgDOVESuUA", "name": "ginux", "full_name": "gmkurtzer/ginux", "owner": {"login": "gmkurtzer", "id": 13984965, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmk